@@@ note
Wrapping must not push block markup to the start of a line. The same text is safe or
corrupt purely as a function of --width, which is what makes this easy to miss: a document
can round-trip cleanly at 80 and turn a paragraph into a list at 13. See #6.

@@@ input
alpha bravo charlie delta + echo foxtrot golf.

@@@ wrap 80
alpha bravo charlie delta + echo foxtrot golf.

@@@ wrap 13
alpha bravo
charlie delta
\+ echo
foxtrot golf.

@@@ unwrap
alpha bravo charlie delta + echo foxtrot golf.
